//! The `border-inline-start` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property sets the individual logical inline-start border property values in a single place in the
//! style sheet.
//!
//! Initial: border-inline-start-width: medium; border-inline-start-style: none;
//! border-inline-start-color: currentcolor. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <line-width> || <line-style> || <color>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-borders-4/#propdef-border-inline-start
//!
//! Author guide:
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/border-inline-start
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

